{"4208480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unlimited Ammo Survivor", "steam_appid": 4208480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A survival game, but in first-person shooter mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Choose a gun to start the game. You can equip up to four weapons  in your left and right hands and shoulders, one magic power, and five passive blessings simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Guns and divine powers fire indefinitely, with no ammo limit and no need to switch weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Enemies in the first two levels usually won't appear behind you. From the third level onwards, enemies will swarm in from all directions, significantly increasing the difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Remember to collect experience stones dropped by monsters to upgrade your guns and divine powers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Synthesize super weapons according to a special formula, transforming you into a Doomsday Warrior ！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· The more enemies there are, the higher their morale and the faster they move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· The more enemies there are, the higher the evil aura in the area, with a chance of four high walls rising from the ground to trap you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Enemies are clearly marked; no need to search for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Using coins cannot reset the game; choose carefully!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Men, fight! </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A survival game, but in first-person shooter mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Choose a gun to start the game. You can equip up to four weapons  in your left and right hands and shoulders, one magic power, and five passive blessings simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Guns and divine powers fire indefinitely, with no ammo limit and no need to switch weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Enemies in the first two levels usually won't appear behind you. From the third level onwards, enemies will swarm in from all directions, significantly increasing the difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Remember to collect experience stones dropped by monsters to upgrade your guns and divine powers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Synthesize super weapons according to a special formula, transforming you into a Doomsday Warrior ！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· The more enemies there are, the higher their morale and the faster they move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· The more enemies there are, the higher the evil aura in the area, with a chance of four high walls rising from the ground to trap you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Enemies are clearly marked; no need to search for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Using coins cannot reset the game; choose carefully!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Men, fight! </p>", "short_description": "This is a survivor game but in FPS mode. For some reason, you don't need to reload and have unlimited ammo, and now you can fly too. But the enemies will continue to increase in number and become stronger. How long can you survive?", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Thai", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208480/0914c75b1ca22608cce0d00dcf62083b6fc096cd/header.jpg?t=1778107283", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208480/c684991560400e699739038cd35e1eda34cb7044/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778107283", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208480/c684991560400e699739038cd35e1eda34cb7044/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778107283", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating syste